QH71CK_jhD5lD9gSmrrIF0BObWGXOnu3sgjEY7AvggX1wGf4N1Mto8ZIMxDj4ng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsjSec2bwsM2tKY-lP2QQ6U1PptKcA5exr0C27O0sRheA&oe=69A6CE40"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer COver.png", "id": "1288041185499986", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982466_1288041188833319_1651999487860440247_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z0FGYLQxwW0Q7kNvwH3hDAt&_nc_oc=AdluWOZF05z7es83oLmN7DvsE24E_hQDOIcmgMsByl7TP79SlcN6OS8MuZ19Pdv2f-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvO4Z_7FBacLbuZMtvjCydmUuoc8cNA91Ao6518glhybQ&oe=69A6D111"}, "display_name": "TinyFins", "keywords": ["cute", "highscore", "underwater", "fish", "mixedreality"], "long_description": "Tiny Fins lets you swim free in an ocean playground, guiding a school of cute fish with a sweep of your hand. Dive past colorful clams, snag bunches of bubbles, and avoid hungry sharks!\n\nWhy you will love it: Super-smooth controls that make sudden sprints and quick pivots a cinch when you\u2019re gliding through the water. They\u2019re a lifesaver when you go from popping a string of bubbles to deftly avoiding a spiky puffer fish!\n\nFeatures include:\n- Shark, pufferfish and squid enemies\n- Highscore system with the ability to unlock ranks and trophies\n- Intuitive, flowy controls\n- Collecting fish of different colors", "short_description": "Tiny Fins lets you swim free in an ocean playground, guiding a school of cute fish with a sweep of your hand. Dive past colorful clams, snag bunches of bubbles, and avoid hungry sharks!\n\nWhy you will love it: Super-smooth controls that make sudden sprints and quick pivots a cinch when you\u2019re gliding through the water. They\u2019re a lifesaver when you go from popping a string of bubbles to deftly avoiding a spiky puffer fish!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tiny-fins.com/imprint.html", "developer_terms_of_service_u